Psalm 119:41-48

41 LÓRD, let your mércy cóme upon me,
the salvátion you have prómised.
42 I shall ánswer thóse who táunt me,
for I trúst in your wórd.

43 Néver take the wórd of trúth from my móuth,
for I hópe in your decrées.
44 I shall álways kéep your láw,
foréver and éver.

45 I shall wálk on a spácious pláin,
for I séek your précepts.
46 I will spéak of your decrées befóre kíngs,
and nót be abáshed.

47 In your commánds I have fóund my delíght;
thése I have lóved.
48 I réach out to your commánds, which I lóve,
and pónder your státutes.

Glóry to the Fáther, and to the Són,
and to the Hóly Spírit:
as it wás in the begínning, is nów,
and will be for éver. Amén.
